# Pose Detection System

## Overview

AiTrainer uses Google's ML Kit BlazePose neural network model to detect human body key points in real-time. The pose detection system processes camera frames to identify human poses and evaluate exercise form.

## Key Components

### Core Files
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseDetectorProcessor.java](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseDetectorProcessor.java): Main processor that handles pose detection
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseGraphic.java](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseGraphic.java): Visualization of detected poses
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseAngleDetector.java](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseAngleDetector.java): Calculates angles between body parts
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/DrawLandmarkTools.java](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/DrawLandmarkTools.java): Utility for drawing pose landmarks

### Pose Classification
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/classification/](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/classification): Contains pose classification logic to identify specific exercise forms

### Coordinate System
The pose detection system uses the following coordinate system:
- Origin (0,0) is at the top-left corner of the image
- X increases to the right
- Y increases downward

### Body Parts
The system detects key points such as:
- Head (nose, eyes, ears)
- Shoulders, elbows, wrists
- Hips, knees, ankles
- etc.

See [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PosePart.java](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PosePart.java) for all tracked body parts.
